      "kitSummary": "Gundam Barbatos (ASW-G-08) is represented by 8 certified High Grade Post Disaster presentation(s) beginning 2015-10. The evidence fixes this entry to its authoritative grade and preserves supported machine configurations within the entry. Supported presentations include Gundam Barbatos & Long-Distance Transport Booster Kutan Type-III, Gundam Barbatos 6th Form, Gundam Barbatos Complete Set, Gundam Barbatos Lupus. Tooling revisions, colors, boxed-set context, and accessories remain presentation or owned-copy metadata.",
